    "html": "<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n\n<title>HesGoal - Free Live Sport Streams | Hesgoals</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Watch free live football streams HD on HesGoal. Premier League, Champions League, La Liga, Serie A, Bundesliga &amp;amp; World Cup 2026. No signup needed.\">\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"hesgoal, hesgoal live, hesgoal tv, hesgoal football, free football streams, live football, premier league live, champions league live, la liga live, serie a live, bundesliga live, world cup live\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"HesGoal\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index,follow,max-snippet:-1,max-image-preview:large,max-video-preview:-1,noarchive\">\n<meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index,follow,max-snippet:-1,max-image-preview:large,max-video-preview:-1\">\n<meta name=\"bingbot\" content=\"index,follow,max-snippet:-1,max-image-preview:large\">\n<meta name=\"rating\" content=\"general\">\n<meta name=\"revisit-after\" content=\"1 day\">\n\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en-US\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en-GB\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es-ES\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es-MX\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"it\" href=\"https://hes-goal.eu/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hr